# On a SHAPE page the knobs stay the page's while keys are played: a drone key, a VOX sound's key, BLOOM's
# or a white key held there does not take the knobs (a hold), and SHAPE stays on its page. (It jumped to
# DRONE, its first page, when a drone key was played while a knob turned.) FX held still throws there.
# On HOME the holds are as they were, and ENV then opens that part's page.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap ENV
turn SELECT 7
wait 100
expect page 7
expect tide0 64
key b1 down
wait 50
turn K1 5
wait 50
key b1 up
wait 100
expect page 7
expect tide0 74
expect dvoice21 106
key w3 down
wait 50
turn K2 -3
wait 50
key w3 up
wait 100
expect page 7
expect tide1 18
expect perf5 0
key b8 down
wait 50
turn K3 2
key b8 up
wait 100
expect page 7
expect tide2 24
key b6 down
wait 50
turn K4 2
key b6 up
wait 100
expect page 7
expect tide3 4
press FX
wait 100
turn K1 10
wait 100
expect perf0 40
release FX
wait 100
expect page 7
tap HOME
key b1 down
wait 50
turn K1 -5
wait 50
key b1 up
wait 100
expect dvoice21 96
tap ENV
wait 100
expect page 0
expect clips 0
